<title>CHILE: TABLE-Chile's Madeco H1 net climbs.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Chile's Madeco H1 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean copper products maker Madeco SA reported the following consolidated results for the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>				 H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit			8.85	profit  3.64</p>
<p>Operating profit	     16.77	profit 13.99</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	    3.47	  loss  9.65</p>
<p>Total revenues		160.21		 128.26</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
